list.requirement:
1. Excellent English listening, speaking, reading and writing skills. English level: CET-6 or above; English majors and translation majors are preferred;
2. Ingenious, good at communication, and solution-oriented with a can-do attitude; 
3. High proficiency in using Office software, PS and video production;
4. Work experience in student organization and association is preferred;
5. Experience in activity planning, drawing, and document writing is preferred;
6. Be fully available for at least three months of the internship. and at least 4 days a week.

